00:18:24.576 --> 00:18:26.519
treat it like that.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.550
You're my only friend,

00:18:31.359 --> 00:18:33.319
but I'm not your only one.

00:18:33.319 --> 00:18:35.560
If you can't say it right, then don't say it.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.760
You're missing the mark.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.119
Did I hear that right?

00:18:39.119 --> 00:18:40.599
You actually swore?

00:18:40.599 --> 00:18:44.720
Where's your gentle, modest,
frugal, yielding code of conduct?

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:49.160
You know all that

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:52.119
and still mangle your words?

00:18:52.119 --> 00:18:53.520
I curse, yeah.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.119
It wasn't a hallucination.

00:18:55.119 --> 00:18:57.319
And thanks for the treats
on behalf of the team.

00:18:57.319 --> 00:18:58.560
Hand them over.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.760
I'm heading up.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:01.839
I was very clear.

00:19:01.839 --> 00:19:03.359
You're my only one,

00:19:03.359 --> 00:19:05.279
I'm not yours.

00:19:06.199 --> 00:19:07.520
See?

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:11.640
It's late and someone's still messaging you.

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:14.599
Different relationships, can't compare.

00:19:14.599 --> 00:19:16.550
What's so different?

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:21.119
That's my partner.

00:19:21.119 --> 00:19:22.990
How can you compare?

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:26.959
Your girlfriend, huh?

00:19:26.959 --> 00:19:29.839
Yeah, can't compete with that.

00:19:29.839 --> 00:19:31.640
He's not.

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:33.319
Still not.

00:19:33.319 --> 00:19:35.359
I'm good at spotting my own kind.

00:19:35.359 --> 00:19:38.160
Working this late,

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:40.359
aren't you worried
your girlfriend will get lonely

00:19:40.359 --> 00:19:41.959
and be swept away?

00:19:41.959 --> 00:19:46.200
Or are you that confident

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.760
no one can steal her?

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.880
If something can be stolen,

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.000
the foundation was bad to begin with.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.599
I've got work.

00:19:55.599 --> 00:19:56.800
I'm heading up.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.800
And the treats?

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.520
You bought them for the team.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:06.000
It's better if you bring them up yourself.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.999
Shows sincerity.

00:20:19.726 --> 00:20:21.120
Fuck.

00:20:28.479 --> 00:20:31.040
Bohai's leadership catches on fast.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.480
They've already put You Shu Lang
on the project team.

00:20:36.319 --> 00:20:38.760
Time to put the company on ice.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:41.600
When You Shu Lang comes begging,

00:20:42.319 --> 00:20:44.920
I'll refuse to invest.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:50.560
I wonder if his standing will plunge.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:53.879
The higher he's lifted, the harder he falls.

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:01.199
Come to think of it,

00:21:01.199 --> 00:21:02.839
I've kept the project and him
dangling for over a month.

00:21:02.839 --> 00:21:05.160
He hasn't reached out either.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.640
President Fan?

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.200
President Fan?

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.800
Sorry, Mr. Huang.

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:15.399
You were saying Changling Pharma
is juggling research and revenue.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.839
I thought it must not be easy.

00:21:18.839 --> 00:21:20.479
We're the secondary industry

00:21:20.479 --> 00:21:25.000
under Changling University in Hua Country.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.560
There's state support,

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:31.520
but it's a drop in the bucket.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:34.400
Otherwise, researchers like us

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:37.800
wouldn't be out hunting for investment.

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:41.599
I get it, the fact you flew
to Bangkok shows real sincerity.

00:21:41.599 --> 00:21:43.800
Once I learned your firm

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:45.359
is led by a boss from Hua Country

00:21:45.359 --> 00:21:47.839
investing specifically in Hua pharma,

00:21:47.839 --> 00:21:52.000
I wanted to buy a ticket that instant.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:55.239
Here are the hard copies

00:21:55.239 --> 00:21:58.479
for the Honeysuckle Drink project I mentioned.

00:21:58.479 --> 00:22:00.839
You can browse it anytime.

00:22:00.839 --> 00:22:02.639
Thank you.

00:22:10.546 --> 00:22:12.066
Mr. Huang.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.959
To understand a product,

00:22:14.959 --> 00:22:17.040
you have to start at the root.

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:19.160
Like this team highlight photo.

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:22.040
Interesting shot.

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:25.119
Mr. Huang, please tell me about it.

00:22:26.319 --> 00:22:29.023
This one...

00:22:29.839 --> 00:22:32.319
Must've been six or seven years ago.

00:22:32.319 --> 00:22:37.800
I was leading a team on a project.

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:39.959
Days and nights blurred together.

00:22:39.959 --> 00:22:42.800
We even won an award.

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.040
Back then, Changling University
had just one research center.

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:52.560
Every project was professor-led with students.

00:22:52.560 --> 00:22:57.359
Most people in this picture were my students.

00:22:57.359 --> 00:23:01.159
We were so young back then.

00:23:02.199 --> 00:23:04.319
Director You.

00:23:04.319 --> 00:23:06.639
You look great when you smile.

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.232
Many sins begin with a smile.

00:23:28.239 --> 00:23:29.840
Shi Li Hua.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.040
Fan Xiao!

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:34.359
Without you to get into trouble with,

00:23:34.359 --> 00:23:37.440
I can't sleep alone at night.

00:23:38.319 --> 00:23:41.199
Now that's what I call mangled wording.

00:23:41.199 --> 00:23:43.479
- Let's go.
- Come on.

00:23:43.479 --> 00:23:46.000
Thought you were done with business.

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:48.479
Weren't you going to party around the world

00:23:48.479 --> 00:23:50.000
like a pampered prince?

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:51.719
I have a whole pile of uncles and big bros.

00:23:51.719 --> 00:23:53.199
Unless a plague or war wipes them out,

00:23:53.199 --> 00:23:56.560
that heir seat will never be mine.

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:58.520
What else am I good for

00:23:58.520 --> 00:23:59.920
but being a layabout prince?

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:03.000
Not like the Nanwa family with few heirs,

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.319
and you're outstanding.

00:24:04.319 --> 00:24:06.479
You might just make a splash.

00:24:06.479 --> 00:24:07.719
I've set something up for tonight.

00:24:07.719 --> 00:24:08.959
Don't be late.

00:24:08.959 --> 00:24:12.410
You just landed,
but you're already hosting a party?

00:24:12.410 --> 00:24:13.239
[You Shu Lang]

00:24:13.239 --> 00:24:14.975
Your phone's ringing.

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:16.760
Let it ring.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.640
What was I saying?

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.000
Oh, the party.

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:22.479
You know, now that I'm back,

00:24:22.479 --> 00:24:25.280
plenty of folks begged to pick me up,

00:24:25.280 --> 00:24:29.839
but I gave that honor to you
and you alone, Mr. Fan.

00:24:29.839 --> 00:24:31.479
Fine.

00:24:31.479 --> 00:24:34.839
Tonight, I'll find you some fun.

00:24:34.839 --> 00:24:36.519
Deal.

00:24:37.199 --> 00:24:40.800
Director You, it's been a while.

00:24:51.920 --> 00:24:53.479
Sorry, Shu Lang.

00:24:53.479 --> 00:24:55.240
I was stuck with a few business partners

00:24:55.240 --> 00:24:56.279
and neglected you.

00:24:56.279 --> 00:24:57.599
You're a busy man.

00:24:57.599 --> 00:24:59.000
I invited you on short notice anyway.

00:24:59.000 --> 00:25:00.359
Sorry for the hassle.

00:25:00.359 --> 00:25:02.119
That might be true of others,

00:25:02.119 --> 00:25:04.160
but not for you.

00:25:04.160 --> 00:25:06.680
We could reschedule.

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:08.319
You thought of me today,

00:25:08.319 --> 00:25:09.680
so there's no way I'm rescheduling.

00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:12.160
I wanted to have you to myself,

00:25:12.160 --> 00:25:14.319
but my childhood friend flew back

00:25:14.319 --> 00:25:16.160
and I promised to host him.

00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:17.239
You'll have to bear with me.

00:25:17.239 --> 00:25:18.560
Not at all.

00:25:18.560 --> 00:25:21.000
You're being too polite.

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:23.759
Come, I'll introduce someone to you.

00:25:26.680 --> 00:25:27.916
Mr. Xue.

00:25:27.916 --> 00:25:29.199
Oh. Mr. Fan.

00:25:29.199 --> 00:25:31.719
Heir to Ruixiang Chain Pharmacies,
Deputy GM Xue.

00:25:31.719 --> 00:25:34.879
This is Bohai Pharma's
office director, You Shu Lang.

00:25:39.479 --> 00:25:40.800
He's a new friend,

00:25:40.800 --> 00:25:44.839
but it's like we've known each other for years.

00:25:44.839 --> 00:25:46.520
An intro like that from him?

00:25:46.520 --> 00:25:48.543
You must be someone special!

00:25:50.000 --> 00:25:54.160
Shu Lang, one key task
for Bohai's Thailand branch

00:25:54.160 --> 00:25:58.040
is securing shelf space in local pharmacies.

00:25:58.040 --> 00:26:00.359
Whether you can break in and find a market

00:26:00.359 --> 00:26:04.040
rests heavily on Deputy GM Xue.

00:26:04.040 --> 00:26:07.920
Ruixiang's distribution network
is top-three nationwide,

00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:09.520
mainly serving the Hua community.

00:26:09.520 --> 00:26:12.040
Thanks for introducing us.

00:26:12.040 --> 00:26:15.920
I heard about Ruixiang's market share
when I first arrived.

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:18.000
I didn't expect the one at the helm

00:26:18.000 --> 00:26:20.599
to be so young and capable.

00:26:20.599 --> 00:26:22.160
You flatter me.

00:26:22.160 --> 00:26:24.359
His friend is my friend.

00:26:24.359 --> 00:26:27.000
Come, first drink's on me.

00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:29.599
Mr. Xue, I've been looking everywhere for you.

00:26:29.599 --> 00:26:31.560
Won't you have a drink with me?

00:26:31.560 --> 00:26:34.119
How could I not? Come, let's go top off.

00:26:34.119 --> 00:26:35.800
- Come on, let's drink!
- Go on.

00:26:35.800 --> 00:26:37.560
Don't waste the lady's kindness.

00:26:37.560 --> 00:26:38.560
I'm off then.

00:26:38.560 --> 00:26:41.000
Come on, drinks!

00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:43.319
Please excuse me,

00:26:43.319 --> 00:26:45.560
- I'm stepping out for a smoke.
- Sure.

00:26:49.040 --> 00:26:51.239
What are you staring at, Xiao?

00:26:51.239 --> 00:26:53.359
You've got a real serious face.

00:26:53.359 --> 00:26:54.920
It's nothing,

00:26:54.920 --> 00:26:56.639
Just something dirty.

00:26:59.160 --> 00:27:02.160
Your idea of fun looks decent,

00:27:02.160 --> 00:27:04.199
but man is he dull.

00:27:04.199 --> 00:27:06.319
Not just because he's a guy,

00:27:06.319 --> 00:27:07.880
but he's just…

00:27:07.880 --> 00:27:09.920
boring.

00:27:09.920 --> 00:27:11.359
He's hell a interesting.

00:27:11.359 --> 00:27:13.799
A saint, really.

00:27:13.799 --> 00:27:14.800
A saint?

00:27:14.800 --> 00:27:18.160
With you, a saint is going to get skinned.

00:27:18.160 --> 00:27:21.200
Give us a show later, yeah?

00:27:22.680 --> 00:27:24.599
Sure.

00:27:24.599 --> 00:27:28.640
Xiao You, it's a critical moment
for the funding.

00:27:28.640 --> 00:27:30.719
What's Mr. Fan's stance, exactly?

00:27:30.719 --> 00:27:32.359
As project lead,

00:27:32.359 --> 00:27:34.719
you need to push,

00:27:34.719 --> 00:27:37.476
stop dragging your feet.

00:27:41.119 --> 00:27:43.479
Hey, this the suite up ahead?

00:27:43.479 --> 00:27:46.199
Yeah, let's go.

00:27:46.199 --> 00:27:48.119
Is the stuff you brought strong?

00:27:48.119 --> 00:27:49.920
Don't worry, it's a fresh batch.

00:27:49.920 --> 00:27:51.239
They'll feel heaven.

00:27:51.239 --> 00:27:52.320
Come on.

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:06.640
Come on!

00:28:06.640 --> 00:28:08.359
Come on, Mr. Fan!

00:28:08.359 --> 00:28:10.199
- Let's go, Xiao.
- Come sit.

00:28:10.199 --> 00:28:13.919
Everyone, have a seat.

00:28:14.520 --> 00:28:16.400
Let me introduce someone!

00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:20.319
This is our new office clerk, Xiao Wan.

00:28:20.319 --> 00:28:23.599
- And this is… the director...
- You.

00:28:23.599 --> 00:28:25.319
Right, Director You.

00:28:25.319 --> 00:28:28.920
Xiao Wan, your job's like his.

00:28:28.920 --> 00:28:31.160
Learn from him.

00:28:31.160 --> 00:28:33.800
See how he handles a room?

00:28:33.800 --> 00:28:36.039
Take notes.

00:28:41.348 --> 00:28:43.000
Oops, me and my big mouth.

00:28:43.000 --> 00:28:44.800
No offense, Director You.

00:28:44.800 --> 00:28:46.680
You're not wrong.

00:28:46.680 --> 00:28:49.119
Office work is service work.

00:28:49.119 --> 00:28:51.760
You have to know the right move
for the right setting.

00:28:51.760 --> 00:28:53.839
Xiao Wan, was it?

00:28:53.839 --> 00:28:57.319
Since your boss wants you to learn,

00:28:57.319 --> 00:28:59.520
I'll play teacher today.

00:28:59.520 --> 00:29:01.239
To do a good job in service,

00:29:01.239 --> 00:29:03.160
first rule is to stay sober.

00:29:03.160 --> 00:29:04.239
If you get drunk,

00:29:04.239 --> 00:29:05.640
who takes care of your boss?

00:29:05.640 --> 00:29:08.160
So, office staff with no alcohol tolerance

00:29:08.160 --> 00:29:09.359
shouldn't lift a glass.

00:29:09.359 --> 00:29:11.160
Here, have some water.

00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:14.000
Thank you, Director You.

00:29:14.000 --> 00:29:16.119
Xiao Wan can hold her liquor.

00:29:16.119 --> 00:29:19.719
She can take care of all bigshots and her boss.

00:29:19.719 --> 00:29:20.920
Right, Xiao Wan?

00:29:20.920 --> 00:29:22.199
Y-Yes.

00:29:22.199 --> 00:29:23.680
That's more like it.

00:29:23.680 --> 00:29:25.239
Put the water down.

00:29:25.239 --> 00:29:27.640
Bring the liquor.

00:29:27.640 --> 00:29:29.200
Hold up.

00:29:29.959 --> 00:29:32.160
Drinking alone is boring.

00:29:32.160 --> 00:29:33.999
How about...

00:29:34.679 --> 00:29:35.680
playing cards?

00:29:35.680 --> 00:29:38.440
Loser drinks.

00:29:40.800 --> 00:29:42.560
I'm in.

00:29:42.560 --> 00:29:43.839
Come on! Cards!

00:29:43.839 --> 00:29:45.959
Should've started with that.

00:29:45.959 --> 00:29:47.239
Fine. What are we playing?

00:29:47.239 --> 00:29:48.839
How do we drink?

00:29:48.839 --> 00:29:49.839
Texas hold 'em?

00:29:49.839 --> 00:29:51.639
Deal. Shuffle up.

00:30:13.663 --> 00:30:16.319
Damn it! Me again?

00:30:16.319 --> 00:30:17.719
Hurry up.

00:30:17.719 --> 00:30:20.359
Want Xiao Wan to feed you?

00:30:20.359 --> 00:30:22.040
I've had four shots.

00:30:22.040 --> 00:30:23.040
Fan Xiao had one.

00:30:23.040 --> 00:30:24.119
Director You had two.

00:30:24.119 --> 00:30:25.160
How many have you had?

00:30:25.160 --> 00:30:27.000
Don't worry about me.

00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:30.719
Xiao Wan's row of shots is untouched.

00:30:30.719 --> 00:30:35.880
She must be skilled and lucky
since you picked her to train.

00:30:35.880 --> 00:30:38.760
Come on, next round.

00:30:38.760 --> 00:30:39.920
I'll deal this time.

00:30:39.920 --> 00:30:42.119
Can't have you doing it all.

00:30:42.119 --> 00:30:45.599
How could I trouble you for this chore?

00:30:45.599 --> 00:30:47.200
Don't be so polite.

00:30:55.160 --> 00:30:56.160
Xiao Wan lost.

00:30:56.160 --> 00:30:57.800
Time to drink.

00:30:59.640 --> 00:31:01.560
Wait.

00:31:01.560 --> 00:31:03.760
Don't make a young woman drink alone.

00:31:03.760 --> 00:31:06.639
Come, I'll drink with you.

00:31:09.000 --> 00:31:10.680
Pop quiz.

00:31:10.680 --> 00:31:12.560
If someone's drunk

00:31:12.560 --> 00:31:14.719
and wants to do a cross-arm toast with you,

00:31:14.719 --> 00:31:18.399
what should a hostess do?

00:31:20.359 --> 00:31:22.800
Then let me be a know-it-all.

00:31:22.800 --> 00:31:24.560
I'll teach you.

00:31:26.160 --> 00:31:30.000
You can say, "That isn't convenient."

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:33.119
"However, we can swap glasses."

00:31:33.119 --> 00:31:34.920
That way, you keep things professional

00:31:34.920 --> 00:31:36.160
without offending anyone.

00:31:36.160 --> 00:31:37.920
If a guy's halfway decent,

00:31:37.920 --> 00:31:40.199
he won't push for more.

00:31:40.199 --> 00:31:41.599
Got it?

00:31:41.599 --> 00:31:43.839
Got it.

00:31:43.839 --> 00:31:45.999
Cheers.

00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:52.719
Sorry, all the good liquor went to waste.

00:31:52.719 --> 00:31:55.440
- Maybe...
- There's plenty more.

00:31:56.119 --> 00:31:58.239
Director You.

00:31:58.239 --> 00:32:00.399
Make sure...

00:32:01.400 --> 00:32:03.520
you don't spill this one.

00:32:16.160 --> 00:32:18.159
You're a really good drinker!

00:32:27.385 --> 00:32:29.008
You Shu Lang.

00:32:33.720 --> 00:32:35.319
You sure are a gentleman.

00:32:35.319 --> 00:32:39.680
But swapping drinks
for a lady one for one, won't do.

00:32:39.680 --> 00:32:41.840
You're right, Deputy GM Xue.

00:32:52.400 --> 00:32:54.040
Water?

00:33:05.520 --> 00:33:06.719
Sorry.

00:33:06.719 --> 00:33:09.319
I don't feel well.

00:33:09.319 --> 00:33:11.159
I'm heading back.

00:33:13.199 --> 00:33:14.960
Enjoy.

00:33:21.000 --> 00:33:22.639
I'll take you back.

00:33:26.239 --> 00:33:29.546
Thanks, but there's no need.

00:33:34.640 --> 00:33:35.800
I've already called a driver.

00:33:35.800 --> 00:33:37.519
I'll go with you.

00:33:46.560 --> 00:33:48.199
Hot?

00:33:48.199 --> 00:33:50.119
Want your collar loosened?

00:33:50.839 --> 00:33:52.960
- I'll help.
- No…

00:33:54.520 --> 00:33:56.119
No.

00:34:08.199 --> 00:34:11.320
Shu Lang, are you thirsty?

00:34:11.320 --> 00:34:12.999
Let me help you.

00:34:29.239 --> 00:34:31.239
Shu Lang.

00:34:31.239 --> 00:34:33.039
Let me.

00:34:36.320 --> 00:34:38.120
Shu Lang.

00:34:38.120 --> 00:34:39.959
Let me...

00:34:39.959 --> 00:34:41.600
Stop the car.

00:34:45.159 --> 00:34:46.600
What's wrong?

00:34:46.600 --> 00:34:48.560
Don't turn on the light.

00:34:48.560 --> 00:34:50.000
Park here.

00:34:50.000 --> 00:34:52.159
Please grab a taxi back.

00:34:52.159 --> 00:34:54.559
I'll pay triple the fare.

00:35:15.399 --> 00:35:17.320
I drank too much.

00:35:17.320 --> 00:35:20.320
Sorry for the scene, Mr. Fan.

00:35:21.479 --> 00:35:23.760
Shu Lang.

00:35:23.760 --> 00:35:25.239
There are no outsiders here.

00:35:25.239 --> 00:35:27.400
Don't call me that.

00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:29.999
If you say it again,

00:35:31.719 --> 00:35:33.719
there'll be a penalty.

00:35:38.159 --> 00:35:40.120
I'm uncomfortable.

00:35:40.120 --> 00:35:42.520
Let me get out and take a walk.

00:35:42.520 --> 00:35:45.360
I'll grab a taxi later.

00:35:45.360 --> 00:35:46.959
I'll go with you.

00:35:47.919 --> 00:35:49.640
Don't.

00:35:51.840 --> 00:35:53.159
You have a fever?

00:35:53.159 --> 00:35:54.639
You're burning up.

00:35:54.639 --> 00:35:55.640
Let go.

00:35:55.640 --> 00:35:57.479
I'm getting out.

00:35:58.239 --> 00:36:00.199
You've been drugged.

00:36:00.199 --> 00:36:02.399
The girl's drink,

00:36:02.399 --> 00:36:04.320
there was something in it.

00:36:04.320 --> 00:36:08.840
So, you swapped drinks to save her?

00:36:19.919 --> 00:36:23.592
Maybe I pushed this too far.

00:36:27.479 --> 00:36:29.199
Mr. Fan...

00:36:31.120 --> 00:36:32.919
Could you… step out?

00:36:32.919 --> 00:36:35.520
I said, don't call me that.

00:36:35.520 --> 00:36:39.199
Or there'll be a penalty.

00:36:40.719 --> 00:36:43.120
What… kind of penalty?

00:36:53.479 --> 00:36:54.999
Mr. Fan.

00:36:55.639 --> 00:36:57.840
Can you get out?

00:36:57.840 --> 00:37:01.360
I might be a mess in a minute.

00:37:01.360 --> 00:37:02.959
Fine.

00:38:29.600 --> 00:38:31.639
Can't see…

00:38:31.639 --> 00:38:34.039
Can't see a thing.

00:38:38.295 --> 00:38:40.252
Damn, this is insane.

00:38:41.840 --> 00:38:43.320
I'd already decided to stop playing games

00:38:43.320 --> 00:38:45.719
when I dropped him off.

00:38:51.760 --> 00:38:55.159
Mr. You, get some rest.

00:38:55.159 --> 00:38:57.239
Thanks for the ride,

00:38:57.239 --> 00:38:59.320
See you, Mr. Fan.

00:38:59.320 --> 00:39:02.473
No man is hotter than you.

00:39:04.320 --> 00:39:05.560
What did you say?

00:39:05.560 --> 00:39:07.080
I said,

00:39:07.080 --> 00:39:08.360
good night.

00:39:08.360 --> 00:39:09.800
Good night.

00:39:09.800 --> 00:39:13.640
I'm sorry about tonight.

00:39:16.639 --> 00:39:18.199
You Shu Lang.

00:39:19.520 --> 00:39:21.239
You asked me out.

00:39:21.239 --> 00:39:23.400
Don't you have anything you wanted to ask?

00:39:24.399 --> 00:39:28.959
I did, about the investment.

00:39:28.959 --> 00:39:31.040
But don't worry about me when you decide.

00:39:31.040 --> 00:39:32.800
I'm just an employee.

00:39:32.800 --> 00:39:34.320
Whatever you decide,

00:39:34.320 --> 00:39:35.919
I won't starve.

00:39:35.919 --> 00:39:37.679
The project looks promising.

00:39:37.679 --> 00:39:39.040
It's passed evaluation.

00:39:39.040 --> 00:39:42.039
Next is locking business terms.

00:39:42.719 --> 00:39:44.719
Trust my professionalism,

00:39:44.719 --> 00:39:47.360
I won't throw my money away,

00:39:47.360 --> 00:39:49.320
even if we're…

00:39:50.719 --> 00:39:52.320
friends.

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:57.159
I won't rush an LOI,

00:39:57.159 --> 00:40:00.159
but I'll pull your company's deck

00:40:00.159 --> 00:40:03.919
back out of the rejection pile

00:40:03.919 --> 00:40:06.159
and have the team reevaluate.

00:40:06.159 --> 00:40:08.840
Well... Thanks.

00:40:08.840 --> 00:40:10.719
How will you thank me?

00:40:10.719 --> 00:40:13.040
Dinner won't cut it.

00:40:13.040 --> 00:40:14.640
That isn't enough.

00:40:19.040 --> 00:40:20.719
Mr. Fan.

00:40:20.719 --> 00:40:23.239
What do you want me to do?

00:40:23.239 --> 00:40:25.520
When I think of something,

00:40:25.520 --> 00:40:26.840
I'll tell you.

00:40:26.840 --> 00:40:28.439
Okay.

00:40:30.520 --> 00:40:33.639
Want me to avenge you for tonight?

00:40:33.639 --> 00:40:35.039
On who?

00:40:35.760 --> 00:40:38.039
Ruixiang's Xue Bao Tian?

00:40:38.959 --> 00:40:40.959
No need.

00:40:40.959 --> 00:40:42.760
I'll handle it.

00:40:42.760 --> 00:40:44.484
What's your play?

00:40:46.159 --> 00:40:48.719
He's loaded.

00:40:48.719 --> 00:40:50.639
I can't go head-to-head.

00:40:50.639 --> 00:40:53.320
I thought you were a saint

00:40:53.320 --> 00:40:55.174
who'd take the hit and swallow it.

00:40:55.174 --> 00:40:56.988
Screw off.

00:40:56.988 --> 00:40:58.640
Bye.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:31.880
What?

00:41:32.813 --> 00:41:34.849
Did I scare you?

00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:37.640
Hardly.

00:41:53.159 --> 00:41:54.920
Got the matches?

00:42:01.360 --> 00:42:03.920
This cigarette really is pretty addictive.

00:42:04.919 --> 00:42:08.039
I'm off, bye.

00:42:15.320 --> 00:42:18.479
Damn it, why did I think
he was going to kiss me?

00:42:19.159 --> 00:42:22.160
Fan Xiao, what the hell
is wrong with your brain?

00:42:23.320 --> 00:42:25.320
Forget it.

00:42:25.320 --> 00:42:27.040
Why am I so worked up?

00:42:27.040 --> 00:42:29.320
It's just a porn flick.

00:42:29.959 --> 00:42:32.810
Just another hardworking soft-core actor.

00:42:36.479 --> 00:42:38.199
Zhen Zhen…

00:42:39.350 --> 00:42:40.479
Fuck.

00:42:40.479 --> 00:42:42.360
There it is again! Zhen Zhen!

00:42:43.320 --> 00:42:46.996
You two really love each other, huh!